Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Maria João Gouveia work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 82, "text": "**Breakthrough Researcher Maria João Gouveia Joins Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 84, "end": 288, "text": "Cold Spring Harbor, NY - In a move that is set to shake up the scientific community, renowned researcher Maria João Gouveia has joined the esteemed Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory as a leading investigator."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 289, "end": 444, "text": "Gouveia, known for her groundbreaking work in the field of molecular biology, brings a wealth of expertise to the private, non-profit research institution."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 445, "end": 554, "text": "\"I am thrilled to be joining the Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory team,\" Gouveia said in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 555, "end": 710, "text": "\"The opportunity to collaborate with some of the brightest minds in the field and contribute to the advancement of scientific knowledge is truly exciting.\""}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 711, "end": 865, "text": "Gouveia, who boasts an impressive ORCID identifier of 0000-0003-3747-5520, has made significant strides in her research on gene regulation and expression."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 866, "end": 1009, "text": "Her work has been published in numerous prestigious scientific journals, earning her a reputation as a rising star in the scientific community."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1010, "end": 1104, "text": "\"Maria's expertise in molecular biology will be a valuable asset to our institution,\" said Dr."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1105, "end": 1172, "text": "Bruce Stillman, President and CEO of Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1173, "end": 1319, "text": "\"We are confident that her research will lead to important breakthroughs and further solidify our laboratory's position as a leader in the field.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1320, "end": 1476, "text": "Gouveia's research focuses on the intricate mechanisms of gene regulation, with a particular emphasis on the role of non-coding RNAs in disease development."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1477, "end": 1614, "text": "Her work has far-reaching implications for the treatment and prevention of various diseases, including cancer and neurological disorders."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1615, "end": 1805, "text": "According to data from the National Institutes of Health, Gouveia's research has been cited over 1,000 times in the past five years, a testament to her influence in the scientific community."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1806, "end": 1952, "text": "Gouveia's arrival at Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory is seen as a major coup for the institution, which has a long history of attracting top talent."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1953, "end": 2101, "text": "The laboratory is known for its cutting-edge research facilities and collaborative environment, making it an ideal fit for Gouveia's research goals."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2102, "end": 2253, "text": "\"I am looking forward to working with the talented team at Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory to push the boundaries of scientific knowledge,\" Gouveia said."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2254, "end": 2331, "text": "\"Together, I am confident that we can make a meaningful impact on the world.\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2332, "end": 2457, "text": "With Gouveia on board, Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory is poised to make significant strides in the field of molecular biology."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "Title: The Academic Pursuits of Maria João Gouveia: A Journey Through the Halls of the University of Porto"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 108, "end": 284, "text": "In the picturesque city of Porto, Portugal, where the Douro River flows and the historic Ribeira district whispers tales of the past, a renowned researcher was making her mark."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 285, "end": 551, "text": "Maria João Gouveia, a distinguished scholar with an ORCID identifier of 0000-0003-3747-5520, had been an integral part of the academic community at the University of Porto, a public research institution that has been a beacon of knowledge since its founding in 1911."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 552, "end": 725, "text": "As we delve into the narrative of Maria João Gouveia's career, it becomes evident that her association with the University of Porto was more than just a fleeting connection."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 726, "end": 861, "text": "The evidence points to a deep-seated commitment to the institution, where she had been an active contributor to the academic landscape."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 862, "end": 1007, "text": "One of the earliest indications of Maria João Gouveia's affiliation with the University of Porto can be traced back to her research publications."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1008, "end": 1164, "text": "A cursory glance at her ORCID profile reveals a plethora of scholarly articles, many of which were co-authored with colleagues from the University of Porto."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1165, "end": 1330, "text": "This collaboration is a testament to her involvement with the institution, where she had been working alongside fellow researchers to advance knowledge in her field."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1331, "end": 1478, "text": "Further investigation reveals that Maria João Gouveia had been an integral part of various research projects undertaken by the University of Porto."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1479, "end": 1629, "text": "Her expertise had been sought after by colleagues from diverse departments, a clear indication of her reputation as a leading researcher in her field."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1630, "end": 1836, "text": "The University of Porto's research database, a treasure trove of academic endeavors, lists Maria João Gouveia as a key contributor to several projects, further solidifying her connection to the institution."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1837, "end": 1950, "text": "Moreover, Maria João Gouveia's presence at the University of Porto is also reflected in her teaching engagements."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1951, "end": 2096, "text": "As an esteemed researcher, she had been invited to share her knowledge with students, imparting her expertise to the next generation of scholars."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2097, "end": 2245, "text": "Her lectures, seminars, and workshops had been an integral part of the university's curriculum, leaving an indelible mark on the academic landscape."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2246, "end": 2405, "text": "The University of Porto's faculty directory, a comprehensive listing of academic staff, also lists Maria João Gouveia as a member of the institution's faculty."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2406, "end": 2559, "text": "This official recognition is a testament to her status as a respected researcher and educator, further corroborating her affiliation with the university."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Maria João Gouveia", "scope": "Employment/Affiliation", "claim": "Maria João Gouveia had been an integral part of the academic community at the University of Porto.", "answer": "University of Porto", "quote": "Maria João Gouveia, a distinguished scholar with an ORCID identifier of 0000-0003-3747-5520, had been an integral part of the academic community at the University of Porto, a public research institution that has been a beacon of knowledge since its founding in 1911. As we delve into the narrative of Maria João Gouveia's career, it becomes evident that her association with the University of Porto was more than just a fleeting connection. The evidence points to a deep-seated commitment to the institution, where she had been an active contributor to the academic landscape. One of the earliest indications of Maria João Gouveia's affiliation with the University of Porto can be traced back to her research publications.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory", "University of Porto"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Porto", "origin": "initial"}]}

